changes traceable to the source.

9
00:00:25.387 --> 00:00:28.456
And the workbook's design
requires the authorizing

10
00:00:28.456 --> 00:00:31.525
official to accept any
autonomous class in writing.

11
00:00:31.525 --> 00:00:36.176
Chapter 08 maps the check to
configuration settings, change control,

12
00:00:36.176 --> 00:00:40.500
